  "description": "Isaac was kicked out of his girlfriend's house on a dark and cold night. Suddenly, a man who introduces himself as her brother appears in front of him. Nowhere else to go, Isaac has no choice but to... move in with him?! This guy, Seo-Jun, might be a little full of himself but he's also rich and good-looking. Everything about Seo-Jun seems just perfect. But then what could be the reason he's showing interest in Isaac?.\n\n(Source: POCKET COMICS)\n\n*Note: Chapter count includes a prologue.*",
